    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.poster.avif?t=1707269064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.webm?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.mp4?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>A super popular fitness YouTuber with over 5 million subscribers... The protagonist, Beom-<br>tae, is happily running a YouTube channel, receiving tremendous love from fans. <br><br>Can it be this intense?!! This is... dangerous!! <br><br>Survive from the fans...!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.poster.avif?t=1707269064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.webm?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.mp4?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Youtuber Survivors</strong> is a BEAT 'EM UP + Rogue-like action game. A unique &quot;One button combo system&quot; makes complex technical movements in a breeze.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D BEAT 'EM UP + Rogue-like!<br></li><li>A cartoon-like story filled with humor!<br></li><li>Easy One button combo system!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock permanent trait for your character!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.poster.avif?t=1707269064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.webm?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/e8613e3392c0215127a6bb2338581b30.mp4?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>A super popular fitness YouTuber with over 5 million subscribers... The protagonist, Beom-<br>tae, is happily running a YouTube channel, receiving tremendous love from fans. <br><br>Can it be this intense?!! This is... dangerous!! <br><br>Survive from the fans...!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.poster.avif?t=1707269064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.webm?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098560/extras/60216897eae9f6851fec396c6afd2014.mp4?t=1707269064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Youtuber Survivors</strong> is a BEAT 'EM UP + Rogue-like action game. A unique &quot;One button combo system&quot; makes complex technical movements in a breeze.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D BEAT 'EM UP + Rogue-like!<br></li><li>A cartoon-like story filled with humor!<br></li><li>Easy One button combo system!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock permanent trait for your character!</li></ul>",
